    "cwc_founder_note": {
      "type": "CWC_founder_note",
      "settings": {
        "photo_alt": "Founder",
        "photo_placeholder": "FOUNDER PHOTO",
        "photo_caption": "Rick, in the facility",
        "eyebrow": "A note from our founder",
        "heading": "<p>Why we've never <strong>cheapened the formula</strong></p>",
        "note": "<p>I've stood in the rooms where a lot of supplements get made. I've seen what goes into them, and I've seen what gets left out when someone decides the margin matters more than the product.</p><p>That's why NanoGreens costs what it costs. The enzyme blend is expensive — most companies skip it, because you can't see it on a label the way you can see a big number of ingredients. But without it, you're drinking something your body largely passes through.</p><p>We've been making this the same way since 2010. Same sourcing, same low-temperature freeze-drying, same testing before and after blending. When the price of an ingredient goes up, we pay it. We don't reformulate around it.</p><p>If you try it and it isn't for you, send it back and we'll refund you. I'd rather do that than have you keep something you don't want.</p>",
        "signature_name": "Rick",
        "signature_role": "Founder, BioPharma Scientific · San Diego, CA",
        "bg_color": "#f4f3ee",
        "text_color": "#2a2611",
        "bold_color": "#5ba90f",
